{"id":"n14687-2-7","stage":2,"title":"아쉽다 · 可惜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14687-2-7-1","ko":"이렇게 헤어지려니 너무 아쉽네요.","zh":"要这样分开，真的好遗憾啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헤어지려니","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；려니：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아쉽네요.","meaning":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","explanation":"아쉽다：可惜，舍不得，依依不舍；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"아쉽다","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14687","senseId":"2","lemma":"아쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b90537aecebf988b","term":"아쉽다","zh":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3","entryId":"14687","definition":"存有一些留恋而感到惋惜、遗憾。","pronunciation":["아쉽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c3bac056d085fbb5654.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14687-2-7-2","ko":"그럼 차라도 한잔할까요?","zh":"那我们一起去喝杯茶吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차라도","meaning":"茶，茶水","explanation":"차：茶，茶水；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61117","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한잔할까요?","meaning":"喝一杯","explanation":"한잔하다：喝一杯；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"한잔하다","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62372","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"茶，茶水","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"61117","definition":"将有香气或味道好的植物叶子、根或果实等熬制或泡制之后做成的可以喝的东西。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"0daf602b903f5088","term":"한잔하다","zh":"喝一杯","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3","entryId":"62372","definition":"稍微喝一场茶、酒等。","pronunciation":["한잔하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b8c115b6f468f064a6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.833,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14687","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3131,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那我们一起去喝杯茶吧？","要这样分开，真的好遗憾啊。","这个汉字是什么字呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要这样分开，真的好遗憾啊。","这个汉字是什么字呢？","那我们一起去喝杯茶吧？"],"answer":2}]}
